2. The 'Conservative' option wiil add the Yates continuity 'correction' to the chi squared test?

I use R version 3.3.1, Deducer v. 0.7-9 with JGR v. 1.7-16 in 64-bit Ubuntu 16.04.

Regards,
Iurie

